The '''Suspicious Red Gift''' is a {{Special}} Item that was obtainable during [[A Honk and Seek Adventure]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Suspicious Red Gift''' was given by {{NPCSprite|Chuckleton}} upon talking to them.

== Usage ==
Trying to use the '''Suspicious Red Gift''' summons a large cloud of particle effects and plays a [[Ghast]] sound effect. Additionally, it displays the following message:
{{Dialogue|&cHONK!}}

== Trivia ==
* The '''Suspicious Red Gift''' is a reference to the {{Item|Red Gift}}.

